{"id":418,"date":"2021-05-18T11:21:17","date_gmt":"2021-05-18T16:21:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/?p=418"},"modified":"2021-05-18T15:00:02","modified_gmt":"2021-05-18T20:00:02","slug":"some-good-tweetstorms","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/qullamaggie.com\/some-good-tweetstorms\/","title":{"rendered":"Some good Tweetstorms"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Not going to be a long post as I just wanted to put some good past Tweetstorms here on my blog so people can find them easier.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Please click on the Tweets to see the whole thread.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>2020 trades:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">1\/<br>Best and worst and most memorable trades of 2020:<a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/search?q=%24TVIX&amp;src=ctag&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">$TVIX<\/a> short in March was my first $1M loss. It was also my first $1M gain a week later.<a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/search?q=%24KODK&amp;src=ctag&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">$KODK<\/a> accidental fat finger halt halt halt $1.5M loss that got me into the Wall Street Journal, on the last page with David Beckham.<\/p>&mdash; Kristjan Kullam\u00e4gi ???????? (@Qullamaggie) <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/Qullamaggie\/status\/1344675459934662657?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">December 31, 2020<\/a><\/blockquote><script async src=\"https:\/\/platform.twitter.com\/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"><\/script>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Important trading concepts:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">1\/ <br>We already know this but still interesting read:<a href=\"https:\/\/t.co\/mJcroNtY7Z\">https:\/\/t.co\/mJcroNtY7Z<\/a><\/p>&mdash; Kristjan Kullam\u00e4gi ???????? (@Qullamaggie) <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/Qullamaggie\/status\/1331865723203948549?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">November 26, 2020<\/a><\/blockquote><script async src=\"https:\/\/platform.twitter.com\/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"><\/script>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Returns and return expectations:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">1\/<br>Let&#39;s talk about returns and return expectations. For traders, this year was probably the biggest opportunity set since&#8230;1999?<br><br>Many people struggled this year due to obvious reasons but us traders have been living in another reality.<\/p>&mdash; Kristjan Kullam\u00e4gi ???????? (@Qullamaggie) <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/Qullamaggie\/status\/1344626907573342208?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">December 31, 2020<\/a><\/blockquote><script async src=\"https:\/\/platform.twitter.com\/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"><\/script>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Drawdowns:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">The best traders are in a drawdown most of the time.<br><br>The best stocks are in a drawdown most of the time.<br><br>It&#39;s a feature, not a bug. You can&#39;t avoid it. <a href=\"https:\/\/t.co\/LrtDi5Y5eR\">https:\/\/t.co\/LrtDi5Y5eR<\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/t.co\/3gKXjZLbSv\">https:\/\/t.co\/3gKXjZLbSv<\/a><br><br>1\/<\/p>&mdash; Kristjan Kullam\u00e4gi ???????? (@Qullamaggie) <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/Qullamaggie\/status\/1376868389906436098?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">March 30, 2021<\/a><\/blockquote><script async src=\"https:\/\/platform.twitter.com\/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"><\/script>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Not a thread but I am trying to make a very important point here:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">This is what happens when you attempt trading without an edge and process. <br><br>The market does not care who you are, where you come from or how much money you have.<br><br>The market WILL. TAKE. IT. FROM. YOU. if you lack a setup and risk management.<a href=\"https:\/\/t.co\/GO2uLPnXoy\">https:\/\/t.co\/GO2uLPnXoy<\/a><\/p>&mdash; Kristjan Kullam\u00e4gi ???????? (@Qullamaggie) <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/Qullamaggie\/status\/1346576742635470849?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">January 5, 2021<\/a><\/blockquote><script async src=\"https:\/\/platform.twitter.com\/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"><\/script>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Not going to be a long post as I just wanted to put some good past Tweetstorms here on my blog so people can find them easier. Please click on the Tweets to see the whole thread. 2020 trades: Important trading concepts: Returns and return expectations: Drawdowns: Not a thread but I am trying to [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_coblocks_attr":"","_coblocks_dimensions":"","_coblocks_responsive_height":"","_coblocks_accordion_ie_support":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[6],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-418","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-stock-trading"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v19.0 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->